# "wave bass" then "reso bass" (bass track): low notes on the 256-sample mip; P2 sweeps from analog into the
# resonance bank and back while P1 walks the position, so the line morphs through both banks.
tempo 124
steps 16
tail 1.5
track bass
preset 115 0 0 70 160 25 0 0 128 0 128 205 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p2 0 128 0 8
sweep p1 115 60 0 8
sweep p2 128 0 8 16
note 0 A1 2 127
note 2 A1 1 90
note 4 C2 2 127
note 6 E1 2 110
note 8 G1 2 127
note 10 A1 1 70
note 12 D2 3 127
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 28
expect peak_below -4
